  "description_layer": {
    "note": "Classifies the tool DESCRIPTION when name and arguments leave the effect open. Each verb is matched in base, third-person (-s/-es/-ies) and -ing forms; a phrase is its first word inflected plus the exact following words. Guards: determiner/adjective before the word means noun use; ambiguous words need verb position; negation within the window skips; some words need a money object or a skip-after word.",
